  "interpretation": [
    "RFC9904 moves canonical policy to the IANA columns; it is not a single support flag.",
    "RFC9905 section2 operator alg5/7 unsupported overrides inference from retained registry validation RECOMMENDED/implementation MUST. DS digest1 remains separately RECOMMENDED for validation, MUST NOT for new delegation.",
    "RFC9906 alg12 and digest3 MUST NOT use/implement; valid accepted alternative paths remain usable.",
    "Unknown IDs reject selection; no unassigned/private-use value is a default signing choice. Registry rows remain a dated capture, not future policy."
  ],
